# Product

Read [docs/PRD.md](docs/PRD.md) before planning or shipping new features.

## Hard constraints

- Static site only — no backend, bundler, or framework
- Citybus (CTB) via data.gov.hk only
- Mobile-first personal utility
- Watchlist in localStorage; `js/config.js` seeds defaults on first visit

## Before building

1. Check PRD **backlog** and **non-goals**
2. Prefer extending existing modules over new abstractions

## After shipping (mandatory)

Follow [.cursor/rules/workflow.mdc](workflow.mdc): update `docs/PRD.md` and this file if scope/constraints/non-goals changed — **in the same turn as the code**, without being asked.

## Out of scope (see PRD non-goals)

Accounts, other bus operators, trip planning, push notifications, native app wrapper.
